        "welcomeMessage": "Namaste! WapApp Support mein aapka swagat hai.\n\nAgents available: Mon–Sat 10:00–19:00 IST.\nNeeche se topic choose karein, ya agent se baat karein.",
        "text": "Namaste! WapApp Support mein aapka swagat hai.\n\nAgents available: Mon–Sat 10:00–19:00 IST.\nNeeche se topic choose karein, ya agent se baat karein.",
